e that delves into  more the background around Cindy and  tells you about other things that have  been done in the Cindy area and we also  have the original cindy paper which goes  into more mathematical background behind  cindy i really quickly just want to show  the github page so we've got kind of a  little bit more about how the method  works we've got some installation  instructions all that good stuff the  documentation site has documentation for  the API but also there are lots of  examples of how to apply cindy to  different systems we've gone ahead and  recreated or reproduced all of the  examples from the original cindy paper  as a notebook in the documentation  alright thanks for watching that's it
 

